<title>HONG KONG: Peace Mark buys 10 mln Egana shares.</title>
<headline>Peace Mark buys 10 mln Egana shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peace Mark (Holdings) Ltd said it had acquired 10 million Egana International (Holdings) Ltd shares, or about 0.7 percent of the issued share capital of the company, on the market on November 14 and 15.</p>
<p>It did not give a price for the transactions.</p>
<p>&quot;The strategic investment will enable the company to share the prospects and future growth of Egana, which is the largest shareholder of the company,&quot; Peace Mark said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition was financed by working capital.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
